lid  or liquid including walls floors and  ceilings although for the time he is  permeable he cannot use his senses and  so he cannot see or hear anything me do  is also able to effectively teleport  from one place to another using his  quirk if he turns his quirk off while  passing to an object his body will be  quickly shot out of the object in a way  that makes it appear that he is  teleporting from one place to another  through training myrio is able to  control the direction of the ejections  allowing him to rapidly appear exactly  where he wants to be in terms of feats  meteo is capable of defeating all of  class 1a by himself in a very short  period of time which alone should tell  you how insanely strong this guy is he  is also able to get the better of  overhaul and chrono stasis until they  use Aries safety as a way to catch him  off-guard and hit him with the perk  destroying bullet but nevertheless when  he has the full use of his quirk me do  is without a doubt the strongest student  in boku no hero and that's it for the  list if you guys enjoyed this video I  want to see more you can let me know by  leaving a like if you're new to the  channel don't forget to subscribe and  united states of smash that notification  bell be sure to leave your feedback in  the comments and you can also hit us up  on Twitter and Instagram at anime uproar  as always thank you all so much for  watching and until next time see ya  space cowboys  [Music]
 

